-- Income Tax Ordinance [New Version], s 120B — indexation (הצמדה), in Part 6.1.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are copied mechanically from line N of
-- ../../registers/source-bundle/income-tax-ordinance-new-version.he.wiki.txt.
--
-- WHAT THIS SECTION DOES. Every 1 January it adjusts "the amounts" (income ceilings,
-- credit-point and allowance-point amounts, social deductions, recognised donation amounts)
-- by the rise in the consumer price index over the previous tax year. The 5785 amendment
-- (tag תשפ״ה־2 in the section's amendment list, src:4337) added (e): no adjustment on
-- 1 January 2025, 2026 or 2027, and a restart on 1 January 2028 from the 1 January 2024
-- figures before rounding. By its position in the file's list of amending Laws (line 5) that
-- tag is the second 5785 entry, the Economic Efficiency Law for the 2025 budget year
-- ("freezing of tax updates and surtax"), Sefer HaChukim 5785 p. 150. That identification
-- is from the list's order and title; the amending Law itself was not read (NOTES.md s 7).
--
-- WHICH TAX YEARS IT ANSWERS. The deposited text is s 120B as amended at retrieval, so
-- this module answers for 1 January 2025 onward: the freeze years, the 2028 restart, and
-- the ordinary adjustment after that. For an adjustment before 2025 it declines: the text
-- of s 120B before the 5785 amendment is not in the sources, and answering from the text
-- as amended would borrow one vintage for another. (NOTES.md, assumption A1.)
--
-- NOTHING HERE HAS A NUMBER OF ITS OWN. The index is published by the Central Bureau of
-- Statistics and the amounts by the Israel Tax Authority; neither was fetched, so every
-- figure is an input with no default.

§ `Section 120B — indexation`
-- src:4337 | סעיף 120ב – הצמדה [תיקון: תשל״ה־2, תשל״ו־3, תשל״ז, תשל״ח־5, תש״ם־5, תשמ״א־6, תשמ״ז, תשמ״ז־2, תשנ״ז, תשע״ב־9, תשפ״ה־2]

§§ `Section 1 — the rate of increase of the index, and an adjusted amount`

-- s 1 measures the rise between two PUBLISHED readings, divided by the earlier one. A fall
-- in the index gives a negative rate, and the arithmetic of the definition is applied as it
-- stands (NOTES.md, fork F4).
-- src:180 | ”שיעור עליית המדד“, בתקופה פלונית – ההפרש בין המדד שפורסם לאחרונה לפני סוף התקופה לבין המדד שפורסם לאחרונה לפני תחילת התקופה, מחולק במדד שפורסם לאחרונה לפני תחילת התקופה;
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 1, "שיעור עליית המדד" (source line 180)
GIVEN `the readings` IS AN `Index readings for a period`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the rate of increase of the index over` `the readings` MEANS
        (   `the readings`'s `index last published before the end of the period`
          MINUS `the readings`'s `index last published before the start of the period`)
    DIVIDED BY `the readings`'s `index last published before the start of the period`

-- "Adjusted" (יתואמו) in s 120B is the s 1 "adjusted amount": the amount plus the amount
-- multiplied by the rate of increase of the index.
-- src:142 | ”סכום מתואם“ – סכום כלשהו בתוספת אותו סכום כשהוא מוכפל בשיעור עליית המדד;
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 1, "סכום מתואם" (source line 142)
GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the rate`   IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount` `adjusted at the rate` `the rate` MEANS
    `the amount` PLUS `the amount` TIMES `the rate`

§§ `120B(a) — the adjustment on 1 January of each tax year`

-- src:4338 | (א) ב־1 בינואר של כל שנת מס יתואמו תקרות ההכנסה, סכומי נקודת זיכוי ונקודת קיצבה וכן ההנחות הסוציאליות וסכומי התרומה המוכרים (לכל אלה ייקרא בסעיף זה – הסכומים), שהיו ב־1 בינואר של שנת המס הקודמת, לפי שיעור עליית המדד בשנת המס הקודמת.
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 120B(a) (source line 4338)
GIVEN `the amount on 1 January of the previous tax year` IS A NUMBER
      `the readings for the previous tax year`           IS AN `Index readings for a period`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 120B(a) — adjust` `the amount on 1 January of the previous tax year` `by the index over` `the readings for the previous tax year` MEANS
    `the amount on 1 January of the previous tax year` `adjusted at the rate` `the rate of increase of the index in the previous tax year`
    WHERE
        `the rate of increase of the index in the previous tax year` MEANS
            `the rate of increase of the index over` `the readings for the previous tax year`

-- (a) adjusts all five kinds of amount alike; only (b) singles one out.
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 120B(a)-(b) (source lines 4338-4339)
GIVEN `the kind` IS A `A kind of amount adjusted under section 120B`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 120B(b) — also adjusts mid-year an amount of the kind` `the kind` MEANS
    `the kind` EQUALS `the amount of an allowance point`

§§ `120B(b) — the mid-year adjustment of the allowance-point amounts`

-- When a cost-of-living increment is agreed for work from a given month, the allowance-point
-- amounts as they were on 1 January are adjusted IN THAT MONTH by the rise from the start
-- of the tax year to the end of that month. The readings for that period are an input
-- (which publications were last before each edge is a fact of the Bureau's calendar).
-- (e) says "notwithstanding (a) and (b)": in 2025-2027 there is no (b) adjustment either.
-- src:4339 | (ב) נקבע בהסכם בין לשכת התיאום של הארגונים הכלכליים לבין ההסתדרות הכללית של העובדים בארץ ישראל, כי תשולם תוספת יוקר לשכירים במשק, לגבי עבודה שבוצעה בחודש פלוני ואילך, יתואמו באותו חודש סכומי נקודת הקיצבה שהיו ב־1 בינואר של שנת המס, לפי שיעור עליית המדד מתחילת שנת המס עד תום החודש האמור.
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 120B(b) (source line 4339), read with s 120B(e)(1) (source line 4344)
GIVEN `the facts` IS A `An allowance-point amount in a tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 120B(b) — the allowance-point amount from the month of an agreed cost-of-living increment` `the facts` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the facts`'s `tax year` LESS THAN 2025
           THEN `section 120B as it stood before the 5785 amendment is not in the deposited text`
           IF `s 120B(e)(1) — no adjustment in tax year` (`the facts`'s `tax year`)
           THEN `the amount on 1 January`
           OTHERWISE
               CONSIDER `the facts`'s `month from which an agreed cost-of-living increment is paid`
               WHEN NOTHING          THEN `the amount on 1 January`
               WHEN JUST `the month` THEN `the amount on 1 January` `adjusted at the rate` `the rate of increase to the end of that month`
    WHERE
        `the amount on 1 January` MEANS `the facts`'s `amount on 1 January of the tax year`
        `the rate of increase to the end of that month` MEANS
            `the rate of increase of the index over` (`the facts`'s `readings from the start of the tax year to the end of that month`)

§§ `120B(c) — repealed`

-- Inert: the subsection number is kept and the text is gone.
-- src:4340 | (ג) [note: (בוטל).]

§§ `120B(d) — rounding`

-- The Minister of Finance's power to make rounding rules HAS been exercised: the source
-- notes the Income Tax (Rules for Rounding Amounts) Order 5746-1986. That Order is not in
-- this row's sources, so a rounded figure is either supplied by the caller (the Tax
-- Authority publishes them) or declined here. Never a guessed rounding.
-- src:4341 | (ד) שר האוצר רשאי לקבוע כללים לעיגול סכומים שתואמו לפי סעיף זה.
-- src:4342 | [note: פורסם צו מס הכנסה (כללים לעיגול סכומים), התשמ״ו–1986.]
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 120B(d) (source lines 4341-4342); Income Tax (Rules for Rounding Amounts) Order 5746-1986, not encoded
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the rounding rules made under section 120B(d) are not encoded in this model` MEANS
    REFUSE "the rounding rules made under section 120B(d) are not encoded in this model"

§§ `120B(e) — the freeze of 2025-2027, and the restart in 2028`

-- src:4343 | (ה) על אף הוראות סעיפים קטנים (א) ו־(ב) –
-- src:4344 | (1) ב־1 בינואר של שנות המס 2025 עד 2027 לא יתואמו הסכומים לפי הוראות סעיפים קטנים (א) ו־(ב), והסכומים באותן שנות מס יהיו כפי שהיו ביום כ׳ בטבת התשפ״ד (1 בינואר 2024) לאחר עיגולם לפי סעיף קטן (ד);
-- "שנות המס 2025 עד 2027" includes 2027: (e)(2) restarts on 1 January 2028 from the 2024
-- figures by the index of 2027, which presupposes no adjustment on 1 January 2027
-- (NOTES.md, fork F13).
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 120B(e)(1) (source line 4344)
GIVEN `the tax year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 120B(e)(1) — no adjustment in tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
        `the tax year` AT LEAST 2025
    AND `the tax year` AT MOST  2027

-- (e)(2) changes the BASE of the 2028 adjustment, not its arithmetic: the amounts as they
-- were on 1 January 2024 before rounding, adjusted under (a) by the index of tax year 2027,
-- which is (a)'s "previous tax year" for 1 January 2028 in any case. Read so, inflation in
-- 2024, 2025 and 2026 is not recovered (NOTES.md, fork F5).
-- src:4345 | (2) ביום ב׳ בטבת התשפ״ח (1 בינואר 2028) יתואמו לפי סעיפים קטנים (א) ו־(ב) הסכומים כפי שהיו ביום כ׳ בטבת התשפ״ד (1 בינואר 2024) טרם עיגולם לפי סעיף קטן (ד), ולעניין זה המדד בשנת המס הקודמת שיובא בחשבון לצורך תיאומם יהיה המדד של שנת המס 2027.
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 120B(e)(2) (source line 4345)
GIVEN `the amount on 1 January 2024, before rounding` IS A NUMBER
      `the readings for tax year 2027`                IS AN `Index readings for a period`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 120B(e)(2) — adjust on 1 January 2028` `the amount on 1 January 2024, before rounding` `by the index over` `the readings for tax year 2027` MEANS
    `s 120B(a) — adjust` `the amount on 1 January 2024, before rounding` `by the index over` `the readings for tax year 2027`

§§ `Section 120B as a whole — one amount, one tax year`

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 120B — the 5785 amendment is the latest in the section's amendment list (source line 4337); the text before it is not in the deposited source
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 120B as it stood before the 5785 amendment is not in the deposited text` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 120B as it stood before the 5785 amendment is not in the deposited text"

-- s 120B(e)(2) adjusts the 1 January 2024 amounts "before rounding". The Tax Authority
-- publishes the rounded figures; where the caller has only those, the 2028 adjustment is
-- declined by name rather than computed from a rounded figure (repair 03-O2, version 0.2.0).
-- src:4345 | (2) ביום ב׳ בטבת התשפ״ח (1 בינואר 2028) יתואמו לפי סעיפים קטנים (א) ו־(ב) הסכומים כפי שהיו ביום כ׳ בטבת התשפ״ד (1 בינואר 2024) טרם עיגולם לפי סעיף קטן (ד), ולעניין זה המדד בשנת המס הקודמת שיובא בחשבון לצורך תיאומם יהיה המדד של שנת המס 2027.
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 120B(e)(2) (source line 4345): the 1 January 2024 amount before rounding is a fact the caller supplies
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 120B(e)(2) adjusts the 1 January 2024 amount before rounding, and that amount was not supplied` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 120B(e)(2) adjusts the 1 January 2024 amount before rounding, and that amount was not supplied"

-- The three regimes, newest first:
--   2028 ........ (e)(2): the 2024 figure before rounding, adjusted by the 2027 index
--                 (declined where that figure is NOTHING: 0.2.0, 03-O2);
--   2025-2027 ... (e)(1): the 2024 figure after rounding, unchanged;
--   2029 on ..... (a):    the previous 1 January figure before rounding, adjusted (fork F6);
--   before 2025   declined (assumption A1).
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 120B(a), (e)(1), (e)(2) (source lines 4338, 4344, 4345)
GIVEN `the facts` IS AN `An amount on 1 January of a tax year`
GIVETH A `The amount for a tax year under section 120B`
`s 120B — the amount for the tax year` `the facts` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the tax year` LESS THAN 2025
           THEN `section 120B as it stood before the 5785 amendment is not in the deposited text`
           IF `s 120B(e)(1) — no adjustment in tax year` `the tax year`
           THEN `fixed by section 120B(e)(1) at` (`the facts`'s `amount on 1 January 2024, after rounding`)
           IF `the tax year` EQUALS 2028
           THEN `the 2028 adjustment`
           OTHERWISE
                `adjusted, before rounding, to` (`s 120B(a) — adjust` `the previous base` `by the index over` `the readings`)
    WHERE
        `the tax year`      MEANS `the facts`'s `tax year`
        `the previous base` MEANS `the facts`'s `amount on 1 January of the previous tax year, before rounding`
        `the readings`      MEANS `the facts`'s `readings for the previous tax year`
        `the 2028 adjustment` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the facts`'s `amount on 1 January 2024, before rounding`
            WHEN NOTHING              THEN `section 120B(e)(2) adjusts the 1 January 2024 amount before rounding, and that amount was not supplied`
            WHEN JUST `the 2024 base` THEN `adjusted, before rounding, to` (`s 120B(e)(2) — adjust on 1 January 2028` `the 2024 base` `by the index over` `the readings`)

-- The figure in force: the frozen figure where (e)(1) fixes one; otherwise the adjusted
-- figure after the (d) rounding rules, which are not encoded, so declined.
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 120B(d)-(e) (source lines 4341-4345)
GIVEN `the facts` IS AN `An amount on 1 January of a tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 120B — the amount in force in the tax year` `the facts` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 120B — the amount for the tax year` `the facts`
    WHEN `fixed by section 120B(e)(1) at` `the amount after rounding`
      THEN `the amount after rounding`
    WHEN `adjusted, before rounding, to` `the amount before rounding`
      THEN `the rounding rules made under section 120B(d) are not encoded in this model`
